  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit and Financial Services: Rural Kenya Financial Inclusion Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RK-FINFA&#xBF;s project goal is to promote poverty reduction and foster climate change resilience and improved livelihoods in rural areas. The project development objective is to increase rural financial inclusion and green investments by agriculture value chain stakeholders, leading to equitable employment opportunities, innovative and resilient production systems and increased incomes for smallholders, poor and marginalized rural households and women and youth.RK-FINFA&#xBF;s project goal is to promote poverty reduction and foster climate change resilience and improved livelihoods in rural areas. The project development objective is to increase rural financial inclusion and green investments by agriculture value chain stakeholders, leading to equitable employment opportunities, innovative and resilient production systems and increased incomes for smallholders, poor and marginalized rural households and women and youth.RK-FINFA&#xBF;s project goal is to promote poverty reduction and foster climate change resilience and improved livelihoods in rural areas. The project development objective is to increase rural financial inclusion and green investments by agriculture value chain stakeholders, leading to equitable employment opportunities, innovative and resilient production systems and increased incomes for smallholders, poor and marginalized rural households and women and youth.</narrative>
